  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Welcome to World of Your Choice</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We believe that we all have a choice for the world we get to live in and the world we leave behind for our children. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">At World of Your Choice we curate sustainable everyday products to replace notorious waste makers in our plantet. &nbsp;All of our products go through a strict vetting process for good design, durability, recyclability or compostability. &nbsp;Just to say that we really care about the quality of our products, they have to look good and work well.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We are a minority, woman owned and operated small business based in Brooklyn, NY.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">When you join our affiliate program, you can expect to receive 10% of all sales that come through YOUR exclusive link. &nbsp;You can also expect clear and concise communication, we value your feedback and suggestions and we will be available to answer ANY of your questions. &nbsp;We want you to succeed.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We look forward to working with you,</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The World of Your Choice Team</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>",
